  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.03 Age-friendly housing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.03 “Age-friendly housing” means a housing unit which contains features which makes it attractive for occupancy by people in a range of life stages from young children to seniors including single-level living.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
